  "ruleText": "Lot 7213.09 Criminal Penalties. In addition to the penalties described in this chapter, licensees shall also be subject to any applicable criminal penalties provided under RSA 647.\n\nSource. #12839, eff 7-27-19, ss by #14341 EMERGENCY, eff 8-21-25 (formerly Lot 7209.08); ss by #14503, eff 2-4-26, EXPIRES: 2-4-36 (formerly Lot 7212.09)",
